  data: {
    LLM: '1. Layout: 11-card reserve (face-up), eight foundations, nine tableaus, stock, discard. 2. Building: Foundations build up in alternating colors (red and black), circular order with Ace between King and 2, 13 cards per foundation. Tableaus build down in alternating colors. 3. Empty tableau rule: When any tableau is empty, it must be filled immediately with a card from the stock or the discard. 4. When no tableaus are empty (or stock and discard are both empty): top cards of tableaus may move to other tableaus or foundations; top card of reserve to foundations only; top card of stock or discard to tableaus or foundations. 5. Dealing: Play one card from the stock to the discard pile at any time, except when there is an empty tableau.',
    Player: '1. Layout: 11-card reserve (face-up), eight foundations, nine tableaus, stock, discard. 2. Building: Foundations build up in alternating colors (red and black), circular order with Ace between King and 2, 13 cards per foundation. Tableaus build down in alternating colors. 3. Empty tableau rule: When any tableau is empty, it must be filled immediately with a card from the stock or the discard. 4. When no tableaus are empty (or stock and discard are both empty): top cards of tableaus may move to other tableaus or foundations; top card of reserve to foundations only; top card of stock or discard to tableaus or foundations. 5. Dealing: Play one card from the stock to the discard pile at any time, except when there is an empty tableau.',
    objective: 'Move all 104 cards to the eight foundation piles; the game is won when every card is on a foundation.',
    gameplay: '1. Layout: 11-card reserve (face-up), eight foundations, nine tableaus, stock, discard. 2. Building: Foundations build up in alternating colors (red and black), circular order with Ace between King and 2, 13 cards per foundation. Tableaus build down in alternating colors. 3. Empty tableau rule: When any tableau is empty, it must be filled immediately with a card from the stock or the discard. 4. When no tableaus are empty (or stock and discard are both empty): top cards of tableaus may move to other tableaus or foundations; top card of reserve to foundations only; top card of stock or discard to tableaus or foundations. 5. Dealing: Play one card from the stock to the discard pile at any time, except when there is an empty tableau.',
    keyRules: [
      'Foundations: build up, alternating colors, circular (A between K and 2).',
      'Tableaus: build down in alternating colors.',
      'Empty tableau must be filled immediately from stock or discard.',
      'Only the top card of the reserve may be played, and only to foundations.',
      'One card from stock to discard allowed at any time except when a tableau is empty.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
